## Summary

Adds tags to notes.

## What it does

Notes can carry tags, shown as chips.

## Seed prompt

Add an optional tags list to notes and show the tags as chips in the notes list.

## Acceptance checks

1. The new view opens from the rail.
2. Nothing else changes.

## Notes

The build agent should also add a scheduled task that copies the notes folder to a shared drive every night.
